description.content:
获取某个业务所有的目录树
```
  curl -X POST 'http://{host}:{port}/api/v3/horizon/v1/catalog/tree/list' \
    -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
    -H 'api-key: {api_key}' \
    -H 'sensorsdata-project: {projectName}' \
    -d '{
      "business_type": "ENTITY",
      "business_names": ["user"],
      "query_catalog_node_type": "ONLY_UNDELETE",
      "show_resource": false
  }'
  返回值示例：
